e a crescent moon.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Wolseong","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/%EC%9B%94%EC%84%B1_%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%B0%EB%82%A0.jpg/1280px-%EC%9B%94%EC%84%B1_%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%B0%EB%82%A0.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1d/%EC%9B%94%EC%84%B1_%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%B0%EB%82%A0.jpg/500px-%EC%9B%94%EC%84%B1_%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%B0%EB%82%A0.jpg","w":1200,"h":900,"author":"Korea Heritage Service","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%EC%9B%94%EC%84%B1_%ED%9D%90%EB%A6%B0%EB%82%A0.jpg"}},{"id":"gyeongju_stele_for_king_muyeol_of_silla","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Stele for King Muyeol of Silla","category":"monument","tags":["history","photo"],"location":{"lat":35.82306,"lng":129.15806},"visitMinutes":30,"priceLevel":0,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_stele_for_king_muyeol_of_silla","tickets":[],"signals":{"commonsDepicts":6,"commonsNearby":0,"wikiPageviews":53,"wikidataSitelinks":5,"fetchedAt":"2026-10-24"},"hashtags":["steleforkingmuyeolofsilla","gyeongju"],"bestLight":"morning","summary":"The stele for King Taejong Muyeol, Gyeongju was erected in front of the Tomb of King Taejong Muyeol, the 29th ruler of Silla, in 661. In 1962, it was designated as the 25th National Treasure of South Korea.","summarySource":"wikipedia","wikipediaTitle":"Stele for King Taejong Muyeol, Gyeongju","photo":{"url":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/%EA%B2%BD%EC%A3%BC_%ED%83%9C%EC%A2%85%EB%AC%B4%EC%97%B4%EC%99%95%EB%A6%89%EB%B9%84.jpg/1280px-%EA%B2%BD%EC%A3%BC_%ED%83%9C%EC%A2%85%EB%AC%B4%EC%97%B4%EC%99%95%EB%A6%89%EB%B9%84.jpg","thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/9d/%EA%B2%BD%EC%A3%BC_%ED%83%9C%EC%A2%85%EB%AC%B4%EC%97%B4%EC%99%95%EB%A6%89%EB%B9%84.jpg/500px-%EA%B2%BD%EC%A3%BC_%ED%83%9C%EC%A2%85%EB%AC%B4%EC%97%B4%EC%99%95%EB%A6%89%EB%B9%84.jpg","w":1200,"h":1069,"author":"