agrammable spots in Gyeongju.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_gyeongju_cheonnyeon_hanu_bomun","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Gyeongju Cheonnyeon Hanu Bomun","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.8371,"lng":129.2855},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_gyeongju_cheonnyeon_hanu_bomun","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["gyeongjucheonnyeonhanubomun","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:30","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:30"}]},"summary":"A BBQ restaurant, also specializing in hanu beef. You get to choose your meat at the butcher shop, and as usually with Korean barbecue, it's barbecued on your table. The price includes all-you-can-eat side dishes.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_hyanghwa_jeong","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Hyanghwa-jeong","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.8368,"lng":129.2102},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_hyanghwa_jeong","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.instagram.com/hyanghwajeong/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["hyanghwajeonggyeongju","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"}]},"summary":"Specializes in Gyeongju-style cockle bibimbap (Kkomak-bibimbap) and Yukhoe-mulhoe (raw beef spicy cold soup). It is highly popular for its generous portions and traditional taste served in a modern Hanok setting.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_sol_sot","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Sol-Sot","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.8354,"lng":129.2101},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_sol_sot","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.instagram.com/solsot_hwangnidan/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["solsotgyeongju","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"21:00"}]},"summary":"Known for its premium Korean pot rice (Sotbap) with various toppings like steak, sea bream, and eel. It offers a comforting and healthy meal that reflects the modern interpretation of Korean traditional dining.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_pyeongyang_naengmyeon","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Pyeongyang Naengmyeon","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.84181,"lng":129.21277},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_pyeongyang_naengmyeon","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["pyeongyangnaengmyeon","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"09:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"09:30","close":"22:00"}]},"summary":"Traditional Korean food, for instance bulgogi (Korean barbeque) and naengmyeon (noodles). The restaurant is in a backyard, accessed through a small gate from the Wonhyoro street opposite to a movie theater.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_hwangnam_gyeongju_ten_won_bread","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Hwangnam Gyeongju Ten-Won Bread","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.8365,"lng":129.2108},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_hwangnam_gyeongju_ten_won_bread","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://10wonbread.modoo.at/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["hwangnamgyeongjutenwonbread","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"10:00","close":"21:00"}]},"summary":"The original shop for the famous '10-won bread'. The bread is shaped like a 10-won coin and filled with melting mozzarella cheese. It has become a viral street food icon of Gyeongju.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_dosol_maeul","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Dosol Maeul","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.837,"lng":129.2113},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_dosol_maeul","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["dosolmaeul","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"},{"open":"12:00","close":"22:00"}]},"summary":"You can experience a Korean traditional meal of Gyeongbuk area here. Located next to the Sarangchae accommodation. The building is a one-hundred-year-old traditional Korean house.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_hwangnam_dagwa_jeom","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Hwangnam Dagwa-jeom","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.8358,"lng":129.2104},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_hwangnam_dagwa_jeom","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.instagram.com/hwangnam_sweet/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["hwangnamdagwajeom","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"}]},"summary":"A trendy dessert cafe in a renovated Hanok. Famous for its financiers and traditional tea, offering a perfect blend of old Gyeongju atmosphere and modern dessert culture.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_ryoko","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Ryoko","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.835,"lng":129.2095},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":3,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_ryoko","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.instagram.com/ryoko46__","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["ryokogyeongju","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:30"}]},"summary":"A popular fusion Japanese restaurant specializing in Tonkatsu (pork cutlet) and Ryoko-style fried rice. Known for its minimalist Hanok interior and high-quality plating.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_sukyeong_sikdang","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Sukyeong Sikdang","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.8396,"lng":129.2139},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":1,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_sukyeong_sikdang","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["sukyeongsikdang","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},null,{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"21:00"}],"note":"Closed Tue"},"summary":"Korean cuisine in a traditional Korean building. Famous for its barley rice, you can also find items and dishes like Hwangnam ppang, bibimbap and pajeon on the menu.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_nahbi_brunch_cafe_books","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Nahbi Brunch Cafe & Books","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":35.8506,"lng":129.2139},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_nahbi_brunch_cafe_books","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"https://www.facebook.com/Nahbi-103418550009342/","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["nahbibrunchcafebooks","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"},{"open":"11:00","close":"20:00"}]},"bestLight":"morning","summary":"Cosy cafe and brunch restaurant, also featuring a bookstore. They have different sandwiches and coffees and it's one of the few Western-style cafés in the city.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_toobbul_korean_bbq","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Toobbul Korean BBQ","category":"food","tags":["food"],"location":{"lat":35.8446,"lng":129.2028},"visitMinutes":75,"priceLevel":2,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_toobbul_korean_bbq","tickets":[{"vendor":"Official","url":"http://m.tshome.co.kr/0547418879/pc.php {{dead link|December 2020}}","official":true}],"signals":{},"hashtags":["toobbulkoreanbbq","gyeongju"],"hours":{"week":[{"open":"11:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"22:00"},{"open":"11:30","close":"22:00"}]},"summary":"Korean BBQ house, specializing in beef from the Korean hanu cattle. During lunch hour, they reportedly have 35% discounts.","summarySource":"wikivoyage","wikivoyageTitle":"en:Gyeongju"},{"id":"gyeongju_wv_schuman_and_clara","areaId":"gyeongju","name":"Schuman and Clara","category":"cafe","tags":["cafes"],"location":{"lat":35.8428,"lng":129.2133},"visitMinutes":45,"photoSeed":"gyeongju_wv_schuman_and_clara","tickets":[],"signals":{},"hashtags":["schumanandclara","gyeongju"],"